}


### read all sms datasets 
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/action/api/action/v1/sms/


### read one sms datasets 
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/action/api/action/v1/sms/35/

### update sms datasets 
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/action/api/action/v1/sms/update/35/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Updated message for testing."
}

### Delete all sms datasets 
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/action/api/action/v1/sms/delete/35/
